02:21:09.590 --> 02:21:16.140
This is within serial television, but Stranger
Things, because they were tapping into all

02:21:16.140 --> 02:21:20.680
of these hot-button passions from decades
ago.

02:21:20.680 --> 02:21:21.680
David Maisel: Yeah.

02:21:21.680 --> 02:21:26.760
Tim Ferriss: But at layering on top of that,
novel storylines.

02:21:26.760 --> 02:21:27.760
David Maisel: Mm-hmm.

02:21:27.760 --> 02:21:29.550
Tim Ferriss: I thought it was executed extremely
