02:22:52.990 --> 02:22:53.990
David Maisel: Yeah.

02:22:53.990 --> 02:22:55.000
Tim Ferriss: Not being halfway through that.

02:22:55.000 --> 02:23:04.310
David Maisel: The butterfly effect of no new
Marvel Studios for Disney to have, for no

02:23:04.310 --> 02:23:05.310
Avengers movie.

02:23:05.310 --> 02:23:09.810
Because one of the things we didn't talk about
is if the movies are all licensed at different

02:23:09.810 --> 02:23:11.420
studios, they never get mixed together.

02:23:11.420 --> 02:23:18.210
So to create Avengers, to mix the characters,
we had to own and keep the rights ourselves.

02:23:18.210 --> 02:23:23.210
And so, just legally, these characters would
never be mixed together.

02:23:23.210 --> 02:23:27.250
And there wouldn't be this interrelated universe,
and the ripple effect and everything else

02:23:27.250 --> 02:23:28.750
is so big.

02:23:28.750 --> 02:23:34.410
And I do think, as people think about their
lives and they think about their decisions,

02:23:34.410 --> 02:23:39.590
we all have that butterfly effect somehow,
almost every day, on decisions we make.

02:23:39.590 --> 02:23:45.200
And that might not be as evident as no Avengers
movie or something as big culturally, but

02:23:45.200 --> 02:23:49.590
it's exciting to realize that your life has
that potential.

02:23:49.590 --> 02:23:57.420
In your own personal life, you and your focus
on health had a butterfly effect on me getting

02:23:57.420 --> 02:24:02.340
healthy recently these past six months, and
a mutual friend hearing that story and introducing

02:24:02.340 --> 02:24:03.900
us, right?

02:24:03.900 --> 02:24:09.180
So, even this podcast comes from that chance
event happening.

02:24:09.180 --> 02:24:14.021
And I think that's one of the big lessons
from that.

02:24:14.021 --> 02:24:18.600
That even if you are just with your family
or your friends, the effect of your actions

02:24:18.600 --> 02:24:21.910
and everything else does create all these
cool things in life.

02:24:21.910 --> 02:24:29.930
And it creates wonder and awe about what life
can be, and sometimes real passion and dreams

02:24:29.930 --> 02:24:31.260
can become reality.

02:24:31.260 --> 02:24:36.160
And in this crazy world that we live in, it's
probably the biggest sentiment I can say to

02:24:36.160 --> 02:24:37.160
people.

02:24:37.160 --> 02:24:39.160
Tim Ferriss: What a great place to wrap up
